                                "sense_id": "6803f53d-cc3d-35a8-820b-b867e468eac1",
                                "text": "Moreover, the Power System is run largely by electrical engineers, who occupy the top two positions. In the past, nonelectricals who have made it into upper management circles seem to be exceptions […]"
