                                "sense_id": "6803f53d-cc3d-35a8-820b-b867e468eac1",
                                "text": "For our final example let us finish the problem posed in the introduction to this chapter. The ideas and formulas needed will be familiar to electrical students, and would be handy for nonelectricals to know as well."
